{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rite of Osiris</strong> is a love letter to the classics of survival horror, a <strong>first-person psychological horror adventure</strong> set deep beneath the sands of Egypt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When an expedition seeking the secret to alchemical gold vanishes without a trace, you descend into the forgotten catacombs to uncover their fate\u2026 and perhaps, to finish their work.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But in the darkness below, something ancient stirs.<br>Something that should have remained buried.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4121650/extras/4a56fef73a7b982985472512476997c4.avif?t=1774643749\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4121650/extras_big/4a56fef73a7b982985472512476997c4.avif?t=1774643749 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE DESCENT INTO DARKNESS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Six months ago, an expedition was sent here to uncover the secret of the <i>Magnum Opus</i> \u2014 the legendary formula said to transform lead into gold.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Their writings spoke of \u201c<i>Sulphurous Powder</i>,\u201d \u201c<i>Aqua Regia</i>,\u201d and \u201c<i>The Philosopher\u2019s Stone</i>.\u201d<br>None of them ever returned.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now, guided by their journals and your own obsession, you step into the tomb to discover what they unearthed\u2026 and what destroyed them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u201cMy only regret is that I will not be able to share this discovery with my fellow man.</i><br><br><br><br><i>I will soon die here, trapped by whatever manner of demon roams these accursed halls.\u201d</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4121650/extras/b8610918cb9c0abc0419e15811974f0a.avif?t=1774643749\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4121650/extras_big/b8610918cb9c0abc0419e15811974f0a.avif?t=1774643749 width=1560 height=554 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE HORROR BENEATH THE SAND</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are <strong>not alone</strong> in these tombs.<br>An ancient creature, awakened by your intrusion, stalks the shadows. It hunts by sound and sight, and you are its prey.<br>Hide, stay silent, and keep your torch close\u2026 but beware, every flicker of light may give you away.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic monster</strong> that hunts based on player movement and noise.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Limited resources</strong> \u2014 every flame, flash bomb, or vial counts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4121650/extras/792be0dab8b658f7df7bddc0aaa0b80a.avif?t=1774643749\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4121650/extras_big/792be0dab8b658f7df7bddc0aaa0b80a.avif?t=1774643749 width=1560 height=554 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SURVIVAL THROUGH ALCHEMY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experiment with <strong>ancient alchemical tools</strong> to craft vital mixtures and unlock forgotten mechanisms.<br>Light the torches, mix acids, smelt metals, and synthesize compounds to progress deeper into the ruins.<br>Every discovery could bring you closer to your salvation.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine ingredients to create acids, explosives, and catalysts.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use glassware and burners to experiment with alchemical processes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock sealed doors, dissolve ancient locks, and uncover hidden passages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4121650/extras/f5d57207742a13756c3766e4afe2b430.avif?t=1774643749\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4121650/extras_big/f5d57207742a13756c3766e4afe2b430.avif?t=1774643749 width=1560 height=554 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First-person survival horror inspired by the classics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic, reactive AI that hunts you based on your actions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Real alchemy-inspired crafting and experimentation.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Non-linear exploration through ancient ruins and catacombs.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4121650?t=1774643749","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4121650/48e72a9ad4eb397b30b45c1e50c4b14d14a41fe9/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1774643749","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4121650/44977d065fec7f1b0c0dd2d54c05598915d7331f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774643749","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4121650/44977d065fec7f1b0c0dd2d54c05598915d7331f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774643749","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h1>Wishlist Now</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4121650/extras/40b79cf5b93f2f801030920f7cd2a701.avif?t=1774643749\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4121650/extras_big/40b79cf5b93f2f801030920f7cd2a701.webp?t=1774643749 width=1560 height=332 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rite of Osiris</strong> is a love letter to the classics of survival horror, a <strong>first-person psychological horror adventure</strong> set deep beneath the sands of Egypt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When an expedition seeking the secret to alchemical gold vanishes without a trace, you descend into the forgotten catacombs to uncover their fate\u2026 and perhaps, to finish their work.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But in the darkness below, something ancient stirs.<br>Something that should have remained buried.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4121650/extras/4a56fef73a7b982985472512476997c4.avif?t=1774643749\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4121650/extras_big/4a56fef73a7b982985472512476997c4.avif?t=1774643749 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE DESCENT INTO DARKNESS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Six months ago, an expedition was sent here to uncover the secret of the <i>Magnum Opus</i> \u2014 the legendary formula said to transform lead into gold.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Their writings spoke of \u201c<i>Sulphurous Powder</i>,\u201d \u201c<i>Aqua Regia</i>,\u201d and \u201c<i>The Philosopher\u2019s Stone</i>.\u201d<br>None of them ever returned.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now, guided by their journals and your own obsession, you step into the tomb to discover what they unearthed\u2026 and what destroyed them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u201cMy only regret is that I will not be able to share this discovery with my fellow man.</i><br><br><br><br><i>I will soon die here, trapped by whatever manner of demon roams these accursed halls.\u201d</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4121650/extras/b8610918cb9c0abc0419e15811974f0a.avif?t=1774643749\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4121650/extras_big/b8610918cb9c0abc0419e15811974f0a.avif?t=1774643749 width=1560 height=554 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE HORROR BENEATH THE SAND</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are <strong>not alone</strong> in these tombs.<br>An ancient creature, awakened by your intrusion, stalks the shadows. It hunts by sound and sight, and you are its prey.<br>Hide, stay silent, and keep your torch close\u2026 but beware, every flicker of light may give you away.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic monster</strong> that hunts based on player movement and noise.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Limited resources</strong> \u2014 every flame, flash bomb, or vial counts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4121650/extras/792be0dab8b658f7df7bddc0aaa0b80a.avif?t=1774643749\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4121650/extras_big/792be0dab8b658f7df7bddc0aaa0b80a.avif?t=1774643749 width=1560 height=554 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SURVIVAL THROUGH ALCHEMY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experiment with <strong>ancient alchemical tools</strong> to craft vital mixtures and unlock forgotten mechanisms.<br>Light the torches, mix acids, smelt metals, and synthesize compounds to progress deeper into the ruins.<br>Every discovery could bring you closer to your salvation.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine ingredients to create acids, explosives, and catalysts.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use glassware and burners to experiment with alchemical processes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock sealed doors, dissolve ancient locks, and uncover hidden passages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4121650/extras/f5d57207742a13756c3766e4afe2b430.avif?t=1774643749\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4121650/extras_big/f5d57207742a13756c3766e4afe2b430.avif?t=1774643749 width=1560 height=554 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First-person survival horror inspired by the classics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic, reactive AI that hunts you based on your actions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Real alchemy-inspired crafting and experimentation.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Non-linear exploration through ancient ruins and catacombs.</p></li></ul>","developers":["Time Break Studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4121650/1d4f5b0659e5ba87d0772f8ee5bb0dab1eb8dbb5/header.jpg?t=1774643749","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 22.04, Ubuntu 24.04 (64bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3-3240, AMD FX-4300<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce GTX 560 Ti (1GB), Radeon HD 7750 (1GB)<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 22.04, Ubuntu 24.04 (64bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-3470<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce GTX 1050 (2GB), Radeon R9 380 (2GB)<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4121650/1186826418/d62982db1cb156fd79c2c7790327c10a714e75cd/1760906980/dash_av1.mpd?t=1761257759","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4121650/1186826418/d62982db1cb156fd79c2c7790327c10a714e75cd/1760906980/dash_h264.mpd?t=1761257759","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4121650/1186826418/d62982db1cb156fd79c2c7790327c10a714e75cd/1760906980/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1761257759","id":257219911,"name":"Gameplay Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257219911/5a02ceead593b0634c1eb18280ebefc5847cec17/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1761257759"}],"name":"Rite of Osiris","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 / 11, 64-bits<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3-3240, AMD FX-4300<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce GTX 560 Ti (1GB), Radeon HD 7750 (1GB)<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 / 11, 64-bits<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-3470<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForc